Code as above, then:

mycol <- c("#FFFF00", "#e0e0e0")

mytree2 <- mytree %<+% df2 + geom_tippoint(aes(color=Factor_B),
                                           size=8,

                                           alpha=0.8) +
  scale_colour_discrete(breaks=c('c', 'd'), na.value=NA) +
  scale_color_manual(values=mycol)
mytree2

Thank you,
Will

