Dear Dr Yu Thank you for your attention,

 Finally the problem was solved, it was not the path_to_my_file. I was using AA sequences instead of nucleotide sequences and pml was setted to GRT.  I back translated the sequences and it runned perfectly...

Kind regards

João Paulo Portela Catani

Em qui., 15 de out. de 2020 às 09:49, Yu, Guangchuang <guangc...@gmail.com> escreveu:
> treefile <- system.file("work", "NA.nwk", package="treeio")
> tre <- read.tree(treefile)
> tipseqfile <- system.file("work", "NA.fa", package="treeio")
>
> should change to something like:
> treefile <- path_to_your_file
>
> see my explanation here: https://yulab-smu.top/treedata-book/faq.html#faq-local-file
